{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/hasBridges","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/isBiEdgeConnected","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/isBiconnected","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/isConnected"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/articulationPoints()","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/biEdgeConnectedComponents()","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/biconnectedComponents()","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/blockCutTree()","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/bridges()","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/connectedComponents()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Graph"}],"externalID":"s:e:s:14GraphProtocols0A0P12ConnectivityE19connectedComponentsAD0E0VyAA12DirectedViewVyxGGyF","roleHeading":"Extended Protocol","symbolKind":"extension","modules":[{"name":"Connectivity","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"title":"Graph","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","text":"Graph"}]},"primaryContentSections":